# Auto-load the pinned dev shell (zig 0.16.0 + curl) on `cd` into the repo, so
# bare `zig build` works without typing `devenv shell`.
#
# One-time setup: install direnv (https://direnv.net) and devenv
# (https://devenv.sh/getting-started/), then run `direnv allow` here.
# With nix but no devenv, the flake dev shell is used instead; with neither,
# this file says so and gets out of the way rather than failing the `cd`.
#
# The pin is not decoration. CLAUDE.md requires Zig 0.16.0 EXACTLY — std.Io
# moves, so 0.15 and master are both wrong — and before this file the
# instructions told you to go borrow the toolchain from a sibling checkout.
if has devenv; then
  eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"
  use devenv
elif has nix; then
  use flake
else
  echo "zurl: devenv/nix not found — see README.md for the Zig 0.16.0 requirement" >&2
fi
